      "sourceTextSha256": "0ff86bc5bc34fba8ec6018a3887cdd97965f36e22f3616b9fa6051e8d968200d",
      "text": "This itinerary is for travellers who want more from Costa Rica than views of volcanoes and the ocean. Over 13 days, you will kayak through the Tortuguero canals, spend 2 days on the Pacuare River, try canyoning and ATV riding near Arenal, visit Monteverde’s cloud forests and then head to the Pacific coast.",
